        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 4:15AM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...SW wind 30 to 45 kt. Seas 16 to 24 ft. Rain showers.
Isolated thunderstorms.
.TONIGHT...W wind 30 to 45 kt. Seas 17 to 28 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI...W wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 14 to 22 ft.
.FRI NIGHT...W wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 9 to 14 ft.
.SAT THROUGH MON...W wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 7 to 12 ft.
</description>
